; DISPATCHER: "z3" keyword.  Release binary has no z3 feature -> panic at ASink::new
; (sinks.rs:1307).  A port that implements Z3Sink for real accepts the program and
; spawns a z3 subprocess -- accepting what upstream's default build rejects.
(foo 1)
(exec 0 (, (foo $a)) (O (z3 g8inst (assert (> a $a)))))
